  unitName: Levira
  unitId: 20582
  unitNumber: 936
  description: A type of sea dragon native to Ishgria known for its beautiful fins.
    Though it very seldom shows itself in front of others, its high intellect allows
    it to even communicate with humans. Having the best balance of brains and brawn
    amongst all of the aquatic creatures of Ishgria, its calm nature leads it to
    avoid any surrounding conflicts. However, when these conflicts threaten its life,
    it fights bravely and relentlessly, showing a very different side of its nature.
  summonDesc: You are a Summoner, correct?<br>Having been summoned here must've<br>been
    the work of fate as well.
  fusionDesc: My power is growing...<br>It's all thanks to you, correct?<br>You have
    my gratitude.
